      "writtenOn": "2022-10-11T20:32:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that we did file this with Apple, and we did ask ADRT for escalation. If we’re super lucky, then Apple fixes this before the official release and we can rip this out. Otherwise, we’ll have to keep this in until the fixed version of macOS is our minimum required OS.",
      "revId": "13dd292c42c94e37e46e5ab301ab7d9713fdaff1",
